flowchart TD
  EVENT[Filesystem / Git Change Hint] --> VERIFY[Verify Current State]
  VERIFY --> FP[Compute Fingerprints]
  FP --> COMPARE{Changed?}
  COMPARE -- No --> REUSE[Reuse Valid Cached Records]
  COMPARE -- Yes --> CLASSIFY[Added / Modified / Deleted / Renamed]
  CLASSIFY --> INVALIDATE[Invalidate Dependent Analysis]
  INVALIDATE --> REANALYZE[Re-read + Re-analyze Changed Scope]
  REANALYZE --> GRAPH[Update Graph Nodes and Edges]
  GRAPH --> STAGE[Stage Index Transaction]
  REUSE --> STAGE
  STAGE --> CHECK[Consistency + Schema Check]
  CHECK -- Pass --> COMMIT[Atomic Commit]
  CHECK -- Fail --> ROLLBACK[Rollback + Diagnostic]
  COMMIT --> SNAP[Create Immutable Snapshot]
  SNAP --> DELTA[Emit Delta]
  OVERFLOW[Watcher Overflow / Mass Checkout] --> RECONCILE[Bounded Full Reconciliation]
  RECONCILE --> VERIFY
